t and get 100 free draws directly! Everyone can be a “lottery lucky dog” and enjoy the treatment of a boss as soon as you log in!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. Research Technologies + Infinite New Games, Super Replayable</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>68 Types of Technologies, Free Research</strong>: There are 4 categories and 68 researchable technologies designed. Whether you want to focus on “maximizing drop rates” (full - screen drops in the later stage, one monster drops a full set of items), “fast - paced combat clearance” (clear levels quickly and get a head start in the next new game), or “idle and win” (strengthen idle rewards, a delight for lazy players), there's always a technology suitable for your playstyle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite New Games, More Fun Each Time</strong>: All gameplay progress (tasks, kills, equipment, collections, lottery times...) will be converted into “start - up points” and inherited to the next new game after clearing the current one! Use the points to directly start the “high - speed level - clearing mode”, clearing one level per second and skipping the development stage. Each new game is a “peak start”, and the more you play, the more enjoyable it gets. Your combat power will always be on the “road to becoming overpowered”!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6. Collect Collections + Upgrade Artifacts, In - depth Cultivation</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Collections, Strategize to Defeat Enemies</strong>: Each monster has unique skills. Collect collections to “know yourself and your enemies”, and combine lineups, synergies, and arrays to achieve “victory in every battle”, a paradise for strategy lovers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Artifacts, Forge Divine Equipment</strong>: As a spirit master, you can upgrade artifacts to forge equipment of 10 major qualities and infinite levels, with attribute stats maxed out! Each point of “luck attribute” can also increase the monster drop rate, making “full - screen drops” easily achievable. The excitement of cultivation and looting is doubled!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
